{"v":4,"catch":"『Funguys Swarm』はアニメ風のサバイバル弾幕系ゲーム。","desc":"『Funguys Swarm』はアニメ風のサバイバル弾幕系ゲーム。舞台となる森で火事が起きて大変なことに！“ファンガイ”としてプレイし、森で作った武器を揃えたら、風変わりなパワーを使ってファイアキングの軍団に立ち向かおう。あなたの腕が良ければ（もしくは運が良ければ）、もしかしたら危機を救うことができるかも？","publisher":"Stairway Games","release":"2026-08-26","genres":["動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語","英語","スペイン語","ドイツ語","韓国語","中国語 (簡体字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"3+","size":"Switch 2 2.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4cc99f9a187e36adc69bf3c8927133309eae4c12e4b55ccdc37296e5392474cb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03134dd5bf25f4733027402cbf76340a23cf939ffd18f4e84446ac0a7ac2f3cc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e6166ef25bf0945e2e1fe9b7c20e8d670ccdf64cb7236aea0a543e10cddb7cd3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/307d870c75382224bbdeec1dde8ed1d92c4d5801ee295531b269930c22cb8701.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/274e1700e27c482c289fe58380404f9175efd5ab8cbef479be353ca34677b6c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a69c920cb346ccfed9fbf8cf680cb5e65bf38b0dc9b85efd26c2ec2e07c7d11c.jpg"],"titleId":"04006d2028cdc000"}